              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Patient-use tubing</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">The patient-use tubing is connected to the day-use inflow cassette tubing for a single procedure, then removed and discarded</span></span></p>\n",
